10705ddf-54b5-4cb1-9a14-52157f567a10.pdf	This document covers the planning and initiatives related to electronic commerce. It discusses electronic commerce initiatives, including identifying business objectives and strategies, using the web for business strategies, and measuring benefits.  It also highlights the website development process, emphasizing internal vs. outsourcing choices, and explores staffing requirements.	application/pdf	1	t	The document discusses electronic commerce initiatives, focusing on planning, strategies, measuring benefits, and managing costs. It covers aspects like setting business objectives, utilizing downstream and upstream strategies, and leveraging the web. The analysis includes measuring both tangible and intangible benefits, managing costs through TCO and opportunity cost, and evaluating ROI. Website development options such as internal teams, outsourcing, and hosting providers are explored. Staffing roles like business managers, project managers, customer service personnel, and database administrators are also outlined.	b274f5c5-9a5e-40ad-8a3d-c35f6bad4a51		University of Science	[0.019179877,0.051792916,-0.04008061,0.01692199,0.015892914,-0.051342852,-0.023822933,-0.04055673,0.038663145,0.020345734,0.0058810674,0.05311281,0.12172973,0.021374624,-0.024383722,-0.0466793,-0.007072097,-0.013934353,0.030229472,-0.005803758,0.03937376,0.00038804545,0.039727964,-0.037665926,-0.0003131458,-0.017862178,-0.00014159933,0.03496128,-0.050358273,0.032746382,0.041636206,0.0006036488,0.025576057,0.027973583,0.025302544,0.04620296,-0.018184563,-0.023100026,0.008403967,0.029500337,0.011906251,0.024313854,0.027894082,-0.0428939,-0.008196119,-0.032745324,0.026997901,-0.008342025,0.0013140923,-0.021116221,0.0308193,0.0060374574,0.04737576,0.019375663,-0.04651588,-0.00772635,0.0052190293,0.025329366,-0.009895832,0.015590241,-0.016184757,0.0038887812,-0.04587163,0.05692904,0.054717697,-0.057264015,0.03266359,-0.025978975,-0.024930207,-0.019802276,0.018884