G-HCM Thi lweng | 70 phat Ma dé | KHOACO'KHI_ , | (SS. e SS I Ghi - Duoc sr dung tai liéu ch. - Duoc s dung viét chi dé vé hinh 6p ai dé thi cung voi ilam\n======================\nCau héi 1) (L.0.X.X): C6 thé n6i ring:\na) Marketing va ban hang 13 hai thut ngir ng nghia\nb) Marketing va ban hang la hai thuat ngir khac biét nhau\n¢) Ban hang bao gdm ca marketing\nd) Marketing bao gdm ci hoat dng bsn hang\nCau hoi 2) (L.0.X.X): Su hai long cia khach hang sau khi sir dung hang hoa hay dich vu phu thudc vao:\na) Gié cia hang hoa/dich vu d cao hay thip\nb) Ky vong ciia ngudi tidu dung vé san phim/dich vu d6\n¢) Chénh Igch giira gi4 tri tiéu dung va ky vong vé sin phm/dich vu d6\nd) Chénh léch giira gia tri tiéu dung va sy hoan thién ca san hm/d vu do.\nCu hoi 3) (.O.X.X): Cu nao sau ddy 12 DPUNG khi so sanh giita phong van qua dién thoai va phong van qua thu tin?\na) Théng tin phan hdi nhanh hon\nb) S6 lugng théng tin thu dugc nhiéu hon dang ké\nc) Chiphi phong cao hon\nd) Céc cu trén déu ding\nCau hoi 4) (1.0.X.X): Trong cac cach thu thap dir liéu thi truong bén dudi, cach nao thong tin thu duge nhiéu nhit va d tin cdy 1a cao nhat?\na) Phong vn qua dién thoai\nb) Phong vén bing thu tin\n¢) Phoéng vin tryc tiép c4 nhin\nd) Phong van nhm\nCéu héi 5) (L.O.X.X): Trong marketing, di lidu thir cép 1a dang di liu nao sau day?\na) Co tim quan trong thi nhi\nb) Di c6 sin tir trudc\nc) Duc thu thap sau dir liéu so\nd) Cabva cdéudang\nCau hoi 6) (L.O0.X.X): Dir liéu so cap c6 thé dugc thu thap bang cac cach nao sau day?\na) Quan sat\nb) Thuc nghiém\nc) Diéu tra phong van\nd) Tat ca cac phuwong phép trén\nau hoi 7) (L.O.X.X): Trong marketing, kinh nghiém cua ngui quan ly dugc xem la loai tri thirc nao?\na) Tr thirc cua cong ty\nb) Tri thitc tong minh\n¢) Tri thirc ngam\nd) Ca 3 cau trén déu dung\nCau hoi 8) (L.O. ): Trong mé hinh SECI, giai doan chia sé kinh nghiém thong qua viéc cac bui hop, cc budi gap mat thudc pha nao sau day?\na) Externalization\nb) Combination\nc) Internaliza