3ef7f167-bd14-4f1f-84d9-68452c6647a7.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về các định luật thực nghiệm liên quan đến chất khí, bao gồm các khái niệm về thông số trạng thái, áp suất, nhiệt độ, và các đơn vị đo. Bên cạnh đó là các định luật Boilo-Mariôt, Gay-Lussac, Dalton và các khái niệm về khí lý tưởng, thuyết động học phân tử, nội năng. Cuối cùng, một vài ví dụ minh họa cách áp dụng các định luật trong các bài toán thực tế.	application/pdf	0	t	Phân tích các định luật thực nghiệm về chất khí, bao gồm các khái niệm cơ bản như áp suất, thể tích, nhiệt độ và các định luật liên quan đến trạng thái khí lý tưởng. Đề cập đến thuyết động học phân tử, nội năng và các yếu tố ảnh hưởng đến chúng, cũng như các ví dụ minh họa về các bài toán liên quan đến khí lý tưởng.	8d7f95cb-d1ee-4beb-a442-9e5a647236a8		Bach khoa University	[0.0031804258,0.03529484,-0.012272991,0.037680585,0.020656744,-0.054499403,-0.034995798,-0.019394346,-0.0007047619,0.045531772,-0.024400868,0.032853574,0.13135539,0.07204267,-0.02520346,-0.0811422,0.015089029,-0.029506264,0.061585084,-0.013837031,0.023248825,-0.05490721,0.020347893,0.007165576,0.03262368,-0.021157729,0.021862311,0.048731685,0.019881945,0.010137121,0.036716793,-0.021844463,-0.0068148044,-0.00653556,0.03750129,0.012130764,-0.01620486,-0.01665459,0.082706936,0.051234663,0.0069509842,0.024424875,0.0331484,-0.04431229,0.018300973,-0.006525496,0.015719146,0.003093151,-0.0017161584,-0.0013842616,0.04152086,0.006173542,0.04768946,0.006917827,-0.06762019,-0.023486147,0.020668747,0.01676806,-0.021607725,0.042799514,0.0022879061,0.026037341,0.0028928511,0.05728404,0.038297925,-0.040470727,-0.026705284,-0.018947987,-0.0070569217,-0.019519841,-0.019436842,0.018269083,0.085889205,-0.004971178,-0.029077021,-0.005225923,-0.02911919,-0.01961204,0.0039466554,-0.041375317,0.018817421,-0.01725735,-0.003336814,0.021550886,0.014675627,0.020939186,-0.026218748,0.029346894,0.02490418,0.05928739,0.032612085,0.002325001,-0.042857036,0.028535873,0.02196812,0.017906314,0.0160