.041274823,0.04032315,-0.055596873,0.0019904412,-0.036377933,-0.044820875,0.06717616,0.049562924,0.009557173,-0.019640017,-0.030573688,-0.035405133,-0.006897893,0.026507638,-0.04216413,-0.004095256,0.06216107,0.029698541,0.014859011,-0.0044574453,0.069440335,-0.065975994,-0.017658347,0.061169602]	Knowledge Representation\nChapter 6\nRepresentation and Mapping\n• Facts: things we want to represent.\n• Representations of facts: things we can manipulate.\nRepresentation and Mapping\nRepresentation and Mapping\n• Spot is a dog\n• Every dog has a tail\nSpot has a tail\nRepresentation and Mapping\n• Spot is a dog\ndog(Spot)\n• Every dog has a tail\nx: dog(x) hastail(x)\nhastail(Spot)\nSpot has a tail\nRepresentation and Mapping\n• Fact-representation mapping is not one-to-one.\n• Good representation can make a reasoning program trivial.\nRepresentation and Mapping\nThe Multilated Checkerboard Problem\n“Consider a normal checker board from which two squares, in opposite corners, have been removed.\nThe task is to cover all the remaining squares exactly with donimoes, each of which covers two squares. No overlapping, either of dominoes on top of each other or of dominoes over the boundary of the multilated board are allowed.\nCan this task be done?”\nRepresentation and Mapping\nNo. black squares = 30\nNo. white square = 32\nHomework\nReading\nR. Davis, H. Schrobe, P. Szolovits (1993): “What is a knowledge representation?”\n	knowledge-representation facts representation mapping reasoning	http://localhost:8888/api/v1/resource/download/asset/eee706ba-2fea-4ae1-89e9-073100b73d9d.png
b6ccce49-150a-4be0-b378-b55f461791d5.pdf	Tài liệu trình bày về động lực học của hệ chất điểm, tập trung vào các khái niệm quan trọng như nội lực, ngoại lực, và các định luật Newton. Nó cũng giới thiệu về động lượng, khối tâm, mômen quán tính, và các bài toán liên quan đến chuyển động của vật rắn. Cuối cùng, tài liệu thảo luận về va chạm, bao gồm va chạm đàn hồi và va chạm mềm.	application/pdf	0	t	Phân tích và tóm tắt các khái niệm trong chương Động lực học hệ chất điểm, bao gồm nội lực, ngoại lực, động lượng, khối tâm, mômen, mômen quán tính, chuyển động của vật rắn (tịnh tiến, quay, song phẳng), động năng, công, công suất và va chạm. Nội dung bao gồm định nghĩa, định luật, định lý và các ví dụ minh họa.	b4a86246-ab33-4ca3-8350-1ae95878d911		Bach khoa University	[0.01638031,0.02616115,0.006916845,0.04986225,0.023728933,-0.061126485,-0.020185636,-0.011428216,0.001785029,0.050388407,0.012284678,0.022743039,0.16900918,0.070794396,-0.025891567,-0.05053546,0.0033728234,-0.0054186094,0.038861547,-0.00812167,0.056951575,-0.0410477,0.013684821,-0.0138975615,0.039983563,-0.0058203945,0.013857996,0.038641427,0.0017773776,0.052606706,0.01753899,-0.036461942,-0.008495748,0.025682705,0.034546003,0.036072843,-0.004124813,-0.01786504,0.08177145,0.034945305,0.02104218,0.0222864,0.03247282,-0.030426325,0.020814389,-0.007975418,0.02915891,0.016591167,0.0022644196,-0.009880839,0.043724056,-0.015028564,0.043729473,0.03109678,-0.03964051,-0.037318237,0.028568272,0.028291652,-0.028211972,0.029621067,-0.009563191,0.03508327,-0.009894184,0.038102657,0.010914942,-0.017065264,-0.03351256,-0.030822499,-0.022801515,-0.0065915943,0.006796218,-0.0022117028,0.09499373,0.010384201,-0.013787984,-0.00018714441,-0.049093604,-0.008826842,-0.023247577,-0.04704424,0.052298352,-0.0020348912,-0.017978208,0.014823476,0.03185781,0.01229388,-0.023375547,-0.003266854,0.023332166,0.04123685,0.02010957,-0.0041362057,-0.058657043,0.0105744805,0.024422,0.024733283,0.02839187,0.008488351,0.031659048,-0.04678741,-0