da11c1c2-1c41-4df6-8ba7-e7e1c9d9808f.pdf	Tài liệu này là bài tập lớn môn Giải Tích 1 của bộ môn Toán ứng dụng, trường Đại học Bách Khoa TP HCM. Bài tập này bao gồm các chủ đề về tính toán liên quan đến hàm số, từ việc tính diện tích miền phẳng, khai triển Taylor, tìm cực trị, đến ứng dụng tích phân và tiệm cận. Mục tiêu là giúp sinh viên áp dụng kiến thức giải tích vào việc giải quyết các bài toán cụ thể và thực tế.	application/pdf	0	t	Đề bài tập lớn môn Giải tích 1 bao gồm các bài toán về tính diện tích miền phẳng, khai triển Taylor, tìm bậc vô cực bé, tính giới hạn, thể tích vật thể, tích phân suy rộng, tìm tiệm cận, phân tích phân thức hữu tỷ và tìm cực trị. Yêu cầu sinh viên làm việc nhóm, trình bày báo cáo, viết code và sử dụng các công cụ của Matlab để giải quyết các bài toán trên.	9bf5ce7d-4f4f-4c80-8508-86b4810a6c7c		Bach khoa University	[-0.006681027,0.0591546,0.00040841044,0.041076496,-0.0040714685,-0.021425774,-0.010738986,-0.009215756,0.044324726,0.00587257,-0.0008490338,0.019937962,0.16826786,0.08415078,-0.032032236,-0.04894812,-0.0011307815,-0.01664456,0.04074597,-0.0023743976,0.030619105,-0.05339048,0.002641977,-0.017371679,0.043722082,-0.018371357,0.035279397,0.042048473,-0.0040787146,0.05105501,0.014648261,-0.019878723,-0.002092136,0.043448992,0.04640817,0.022045545,0.0021716913,-0.059907377,0.07165977,0.042961124,0.011653245,0.024506561,0.04541937,-0.058235206,0.018400045,-0.025175227,0.022524076,-0.011189572,-3.0332236e-05,-0.032565463,0.031487323,0.017260175,0.021311915,0.025419671,-0.035933547,9.777333e-05,0.040815115,0.020024246,-0.039564528,0.022343546,0.0059004338,0.043858793,-0.008725567,0.056345224,0.01442245,-0.007678943,-0.0015260021,-0.0277411,-0.019269617,-0.033770192,0.0059391255,-0.0075622327,0.09525318,0.015986633,-0.04591172,-0.033048116,-0.037987117,0.012905649,0.009282015,-0.029560262,0.053977247,-0.01753244,-0.004876421,0.031630084,0.036948577,-0.004517572,-0.05951297,0.04458823,0.026972366,0.03819428,0.035974853,-0.014173062,-0.