1b0768bd-40e8-462e-9c6b-bd4c5fb707cc.pdf	Bài giảng này giới thiệu về phân tích từ vựng, bao gồm các khái niệm như lexemes và tokens. Tài liệu trình bày cách xây dựng bộ phân tích từ vựng và các công cụ như biểu thức chính quy và tự động hữu hạn. Cuối cùng, nó đề cập đến việc sử dụng ANTLR để tạo bộ phân tích từ vựng.	application/pdf	0	t	This document discusses Lexical Analysis, the initial phase of compilation, focusing on identifying and classifying lexemes into tokens. It covers the roles of a lexical analyzer, including identifying lexemes, returning tokens, and managing spaces and token positions. The document explains rule representations using Finite Automata (DFA, NFA) and Regular Expressions. Examples are provided to illustrate these concepts, including the use of ANTLR for lexical analysis and examples of regular expressions for programming language keywords and numeric values. The document also includes a summary of how to write a lexical analyzer (lexer) in ANTLR.	e5e7037f-8466-46dc-bc03-86e4a926507e		Bach khoa University	[0.0018227071,0.041606653,-0.011118607,0.04679045,0.0076932446,-0.051729895,-0.023708615,-0.047452312,0.020685416,0.055775158,-0.0011383167,0.011646638,0.11237331,0.046955653,-0.035653878,-0.06598533,0.007722571,0.0029709502,0.044333532,-0.040515464,0.0467214,-0.039259657,0.006666659,-0.0150841735,0.009465128,-0.002757639,0.03919142,0.018977676,-0.0024781094,0.09243836,0.053746022,-0.031288873,0.009838717,0.02638012,0.026614966,0.015428596,-0.00025779827,-0.022130368,0.025893733,0.032255758,0.023693763,-0.0049659894,0.013130512,-0.03745869,0.029900491,-0.014912935,0.017558087,0.020839093,-0.0073809987,-0.033962287,0.04461503,-0.026202885,0.039510418,0.008465179,-0.029713534,-0.034522388,0.0055956254,0.027348278,-0.046803743,0.049645975,-0.015126422,0.024202691,-0.0010948308,0.036708925,0.052528694,-0.0102150375,-0.00766386,-0.028178535,-0.009034114,-0.011932376,0.0107382685,-0.017092243,0.06610388,0.004416549,-0.042508673,-0.01088934,-0.