3950015d-9ec8-45b4-ab22-383d7b61c157.pdf	Đề thi bao gồm 18 câu hỏi về giải tích 1, bao gồm các kiến thức về hàm số, tập xác định, tính cực trị, giới hạn, và ứng dụng của tích phân. Các câu hỏi yêu cầu học sinh xác định các tính chất, tìm giá trị lớn nhất, nhỏ nhất, và giải các bài toán liên quan đến các khái niệm này. Đề thi tập trung vào việc đánh giá khả năng áp dụng các kiến thức đã học vào giải quyết các bài toán cụ thể.	application/pdf	0	t	Đề thi giữa kỳ môn Giải tích 1, gồm 18 câu hỏi trắc nghiệm liên quan đến các khái niệm cơ bản của giải tích như giới hạn, đạo hàm, tích phân, hàm số, cực trị, khai triển Taylor, ứng dụng của đạo hàm và tích phân. Nội dung bao gồm các bài toán về tìm giới hạn, xét tính liên tục, khả vi, tìm cực trị, tìm điểm uốn, ứng dụng vào bài toán thực tế như tính thể tích, diện tích, tốc độ lây nhiễm bệnh.	034b2ec1-a472-4d67-8544-4704b9cb563e		Bach khoa University	[0.0146433115,0.044457104,-0.014133524,0.045027554,0.0073107877,-0.033398088,-0.038790137,-0.033989456,0.04547483,0.020518834,0.028396111,0.020655911,0.14645968,0.060636733,-0.030785153,-0.070206635,0.013288493,-0.023608046,0.03749315,0.003413403,0.026271056,-0.055715602,-0.0050813486,-0.01001835,0.035623588,-0.020459253,0.038314268,0.041994203,0.019130021,0.025501883,0.015605099,-0.016111206,0.01563803,0.055569496,0.0532245,0.016711207,-0.009797698,-0.053421665,0.07805487,0.036965594,0.0306183,0.04832551,0.047674894,-0.06480821,0.021707704,-0.041293934,0.033537462,0.0037719153,-0.020127788,-0.01745354,0.024764935,0.004513158,0.017605754,0.024912696,-0.054528553,0.0014129457,0.036050525,0.02638505,-0.020339703,0.0219261,0.016177362,0.026759727,-0.008855314,0.038571693,0.030160798,-0.025017865,-0.0011350783,-0.03995844,-0.027299318,-0.024161965,-0.0072421464,0.007977163,0.07852128,0.010397126,-0.03127979,-0.008873125,-0.021049436,0.006354554,0.01615064,-0.03770253,0.05643955,0.00083502475,0.0035264906,0.018969981,0.012044492,-0.022601647,-0.03891095,0.025567112,0.036395486,0.0462