89cd2f57-2f62-4b6a-a825-b357bee4b08a.pdf	Chương này trình bày về hiện tượng cảm ứng điện từ và các định luật liên quan như Faraday và Lenz. Tiếp theo là hiện tượng tự cảm, định luật và công thức tính. Cuối cùng, chương đề cập đến năng lượng từ trường và các ví dụ ứng dụng.	application/pdf	0	t	Phân tích các hiện tượng cảm ứng điện từ, bao gồm cảm ứng điện từ, định luật Faraday, Lenz, tự cảm, năng lượng từ trường. Các bài toán ứng dụng về thanh dẫn, khung dây, đĩa kim loại chuyển động trong từ trường và các ví dụ tính toán liên quan đến dòng điện cảm ứng, suất điện động, và lực từ.	2aca2d0d-16c3-4d4b-aeb5-5aae42aa6904		Bach khoa University	[-0.013657307,0.03634683,-0.012193218,0.03178962,0.026718223,-0.034543898,-0.03903607,-0.023942342,-0.0022061546,0.03218243,0.012677839,0.025453212,0.16968763,0.050655685,-0.012564668,-0.058685143,-0.006412447,-0.0010062135,0.05452917,-0.041494586,0.056394733,-0.036839448,0.04302772,-0.012055932,0.023650737,-0.011539343,0.01063305,0.018403027,-0.015278869,0.009603705,0.032930948,-0.016542945,0.010389033,0.029145086,0.040752064,0.019398935,0.015734382,-0.023248738,0.061247997,0.021544946,0.014344427,0.027297303,0.009196958,-0.040788263,0.033889666,-0.030053815,0.019389812,0.007233912,-0.013513957,-0.0006783829,0.021714581,-0.020930627,0.060896244,0.028689837,-0.03971426,-0.043479923,0.022815203,0.02710345,-0.015735041,0.042307064,-0.009216239,0.025665026,-0.006103639,0.050687578,0.0153615195,-0.020719478,-0.036618505,-0.034106083,-0.0072325566,-0.038228046,-0.012181365,0.018297134,0.05832245,-0.0121548865,0.008842366,-0.010076613,-0.034730125,0.010640497,0.008453192,-0.03523078,0.0072184047,-0.011238489,0.01875945,0.00080617587,0.029364694,0.0053856433,-0.034372427,0.033419948,0.027724449,0.052483145,0.02900433,0.008753387,-0.039137565,0.019673172,0.035027765,0.027934354,0.013204195,0.0057480093,0.038726345,-0.03697031,-0.008891533,-0.090001605,-0.03856074,-0.03147293,-0.018244792,-0.02775583,-0.03222768,-0.059828393,-0.008673493,-0.