62b746b8-9b2e-4ffc-a414-0237293630b4.pdf	Tài liệu trình bày về các khía cạnh liên quan đến thương mại điện tử, đặc biệt là quá trình lập kế hoạch. Nó bao gồm các bước khởi xướng, mục tiêu kinh doanh, chiến lược, và các yếu tố để đo lường lợi ích. Đồng thời, tài liệu đề cập đến việc phát triển trang web, bao gồm cả nội bộ và thuê ngoài, cùng với các yếu tố như chi phí, lợi tức đầu tư (ROI). Cuối cùng, nó cũng tập trung vào việc bố trí nhân sự, bao gồm các vai trò như quản lý kinh doanh, quản lý dự án, và các chuyên gia khác.	application/pdf	2	t	The document explores electronic commerce initiatives, covering business objectives, strategies, and measuring benefits. It discusses website development, comparing internal and outsourcing approaches, including early, late, and partial outsourcing strategies. Key aspects include cost management, ROI analysis, hosting provider selection, staffing roles like business managers, project managers, and various specialists. The content emphasizes factors such as security, scalability, and the roles of different personnel in successful e-commerce operations, touching upon customer service, database administration, and payment systems.	56f26b47-eedc-4ccd-a0cc-39032fc64e6d		Bach Khoa University	[0.02434985,0.04256931,-0.030532897,0.011247527,0.007102725,-0.04312316,-0.012864206,-0.03489759,0.042230416,0.024398593,0.009850929,0.031349104,0.13893983,0.017082743,-0.021696907,-0.03809784,-0.0031236159,-0.01854042,0.034169625,-0.007875798,0.04753136,-0.000593192,0.026609289,-0.040041618,0.0029518846,-0.01971143,-0.0063866787,0.017549394,-0.048646517,0.04360643,0.0420675,-0.013555324,0.018471625,0.024181934,0.011198625,0.041572146,-0.01244232,-0.029918283,-0.0015295347,0.03429264,0.00047762305,0.02667331,0.026142927,-0.04050755,0.0019376195,-0.018167803,0.033755273,-0.009475502,0.004576726,-0.017432919,0.03540982,0.024540702,0.05382373,0.0035025063,-0.032330643,-0.019556204,0.00011244839,0.03497177,-0.0118606975,0.01185305,-0.026912205,-0.00