39fa9638-2473-40f7-8e34-b5865540819d.pdf	Tài liệu này giới thiệu về ngôn ngữ lập trình Python. Nó bắt đầu bằng việc giới thiệu về Python, sau đó đi sâu vào các khái niệm cơ bản như biến, câu lệnh, vòng lặp và hàm. Các ví dụ minh họa được cung cấp để giúp người đọc hiểu rõ hơn về cách sử dụng Python.	application/pdf	0	t	This document introduces the Python programming language, created by Guido van Rossum in 1991. It highlights Python's use in various areas, emphasizing readability through indentation and dynamic typing. Basic concepts such as variables, comments, statements (assignments, if, pass), and loop structures (while, for, break, continue) are explained. The document also touches upon user-defined and built-in functions, providing examples and references for further learning.	1ec773a3-83cb-491f-99a6-7d630d453ff3		Bach khoa University	[0.00806268,0.051371537,-0.009478208,0.022765856,0.012670224,-0.032916,-0.008411287,-0.034764156,0.002199184,0.032597408,-0.049834758,0.023592394,0.09806395,0.025826298,-0.03705395,-0.04782452,0.0015179612,0.013674329,0.019644717,-0.01160064,0.036600746,-0.03428783,-0.005029981,-0.035783388,0.0042941542,-0.02497808,0.050929654,0.030269394,-0.023793865,0.047367003,0.044350427,-0.009859484,0.032791317,0.03472455,0.02603825,-0.0029468753,0.00837322,-0.030458335,0.05539379,0.019276943,0.059805825,0.029549215,0.0037857469,-0.035948053,0.026151149,-0.029882519,0.022180324,0.010259568,0.001583426,-0.031706624,0.034800198,0.008204975,0.038564265,0.026604945,-0.07235706,-0.030615276,0.0049534487,-0.0031091967,-0.013993836,0.030140094,0.028030464,0.05853447,-0.0047338563,0.028521094,0.009417862,-0.040406995,0.015950182,-0.023208283,-0.0064493935,-0.008645217,-0.003913094,-0.009250524,0.05597525,-0.045298696,-0.031902935,0.005978251,-0.016325798,0.025760595,-0.022768103,-0.039120298,0.051780485,0.036164775,-0.007816466,0.04265723,-0.0010290681,-0.015839083,-0.010859825,0.022857208,0.026254779,0.047498673,0.016559131,-0.01513601,-0.022657378