6271579b-410f-4a53-a26d-366857f31d5b.pdf	Tài liệu này là bài giảng điện tử về tích phân bất định, bao gồm các khái niệm, định nghĩa cơ bản về nguyên hàm, tích phân bất định. Nó trình bày các phương pháp tính tích phân, bao gồm đổi biến, tích phân từng phần, và các trường hợp đặc biệt. Ngoài ra, tài liệu còn đề cập đến việc tính tích phân của các hàm hữu tỉ, hàm lượng giác, và hàm vô tỉ.	application/pdf	0	t	Bài giảng về tích phân bất định, bao gồm các khái niệm, định nghĩa, định lý, quy tắc và phương pháp tính toán. Các chủ đề chính bao gồm nguyên hàm, đạo hàm, phương pháp đổi biến, tích phân từng phần, tích phân hữu tỉ, tích phân Tre-bư-xếp và các dạng tích phân lượng giác. Bài giảng cũng đề cập đến các trường hợp đặc biệt và các phương pháp giải quyết các dạng tích phân khác nhau.	1fcb447d-427d-4801-950d-d875b9423fa6		Bach khoa University	[0.004338318,0.06032974,-0.007875687,0.039201107,-0.013920918,-0.04050286,-0.044162977,-0.024348695,0.012126929,0.005375295,0.01546646,0.0040901373,0.13860704,0.07048218,-0.021341415,-0.07083605,0.021946743,-0.024340192,0.032308288,0.0076072114,0.025995672,-0.030517923,0.01639774,-0.0040217545,0.022335792,-0.019831302,0.046397567,0.024151783,-0.0041656946,0.047723107,0.017940605,0.003423032,-0.0007756997,0.057519924,0.024180653,0.024457969,-0.0098688975,-0.03886506,0.038706228,0.009200723,-0.0077356542,0.04339291,0.0061478247,-0.03080631,0.01944484,-0.02911938,0.030212475,0.0135909,-0.014106261,-0.028746927,0.050261416,0.017189054,0.03015901,0.014835637,-0.04826561,-0.01242251,0.02925203,0.053986795,-0.012195145,0.039237007,0.008263765,0.044140857,-0.028863685,0.0254279,0.022148084,-0.03208421,-0.003992764,-0.010377015,-0.013808465,-0.01810133,-0.006576416,-0.012583921,0.09103152,-0.014671656,-0.02286838,-0.019698584,-0.02968868,0.022444917,0.010312279,-0.031661395,0.036087736,0.014582683,-0.0053969654,0.042985044,0.021824649,-0.013740557,-0.027867384,0.059652932,0.025556352,0.052446093,0.024687072,-0.018130427,-0.034177586,0.0360