1c20f68e-05a5-45f9-8b86-5ed5febc19d2.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về khái niệm vật dẫn, nơi các hạt mang điện có thể di chuyển. Nó thảo luận về hiện tượng điện hưởng khi vật dẫn đặt trong điện trường, cũng như các khái niệm về điện dung của vật dẫn và tụ điện. Cuối cùng, nó tập trung vào năng lượng điện trường và ứng dụng các công thức liên quan đến các bài toán về điện trường.	application/pdf	0	t	Phân tích chương VII về vật dẫn, bao gồm các khái niệm về vật dẫn, cân bằng tĩnh điện, hiện tượng điện hưởng, điện dung, tụ điện và năng lượng điện trường. Trình bày các công thức tính toán và các ví dụ minh họa liên quan đến điện trường, điện thế, điện dung và năng lượng của hệ điện tích và tụ điện.	fa87e1d2-0107-49e5-877b-076e047067b2		Bach khoa University	[0.006316739,0.032609604,-0.015911473,0.038590953,0.037944827,-0.044648156,-0.030807076,-0.021756945,0.0151047595,0.04099513,0.01892984,0.029938372,0.17689657,0.069492884,-0.030441238,-0.05977689,0.008747724,-0.007197145,0.059821904,-0.013661981,0.03264842,-0.034597784,0.029125981,0.0064124903,0.017611397,-0.03454344,0.018764218,0.037417356,-0.018298885,0.0076497877,0.010036478,-0.021533815,-0.0023039882,0.039356172,0.054248396,0.008769645,0.022839662,-0.030982498,0.05392555,0.05300762,0.006439988,0.04436576,0.036518916,-0.039305024,0.006535383,-0.036812276,0.027483199,0.010765727,-0.010015251,0.0017792704,0.031374753,-0.023732143,0.06347925,0.030968493,-0.09548659,-0.020777639,0.0155210355,0.028695466,-0.022839513,0.0042007426,-0.007695077,0.04328807,-0.012639935,0.072798476,0.013874455,-0.021994391,-0.02035881,-0.015017538,-0.027502779,-0.04237749,-0.018594103,0.010275306,0.08060707,0.006746988,-0.03620683,-0.013859986,-0.006450984,-0.0045359647,0.03870399,-0.031873837,0.038824853,0.01676057,0.0073583336,0.018291358,0.03694658,0.02122046,-0.0029542418,0.031255476,0.022753997,0.03522521,0.03975632,0.0058337166,-0.043368142,0.027412763,0.020983655,0.03433561,0.018541317,0.01968483,0.021218095,-0.04051593,-0.02056152,-0.0