b934a5a6-2000-48e9-9a2c-947901b5ecb7.pdf	Tài liệu này giới thiệu về Hệ thống Quản lý Cơ sở dữ liệu (DBMS). Nội dung bao gồm khái niệm, kiến trúc, và các thành phần chính của DBMS như bộ xử lý truy vấn, quản lý bộ nhớ đệm, và xử lý giao dịch. Tài liệu cũng đề cập đến các khả năng của DBMS, đồng thời thảo luận về việc khi nào nên và không nên sử dụng DBMS.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides an overview of Database Management Systems (DBMS), covering topics such as system architecture, query processing, transaction management, and database recovery. It discusses the components of a DBMS, including storage management, buffer management, and query compilation. The document also delves into transaction properties like atomicity, isolation, and durability, along with the roles of various professionals within a DBMS environment. Additionally, it explores the evolution and classification of DBMS, highlighting different data models like relational, object-oriented, NoSQL, and NewSQL.	e916aef0-5611-427f-90ae-11ec08309cef		Bach khoa University	[0.023148976,0.04720218,0.0023346893,0.024276739,0.040625677,-0.04065223,-0.011509536,-0.034000084,0.017762179,0.012961509,-0.018311847,0.021053197,0.11446644,0.023032097,-0.0354314,-0.055563763,-0.00794733,-0.021126753,0.019866057,-0.007820226,0.07620288,-0.008930035,0.039344806,-0.021277389,-0.0051288754,-0.0074259653,0.045887616,0.020946717,-0.024199562,0.0605398,0.024067922,-0.028343342,0.023694815,0.023607846,0.018343624,0.008163312,-0.0021808324,-0.03119813,0.015800338,0.028796889,0.028474245,0.022381429,0.023797616,-0.046458222,0.02022181,-0.020300712,0.038699403,0.006304983,-0.024910297,-0.040617447,0.028395018,-0.009188417,0.048122313,0.016621124,-0.038606945,-0.034892745,0.03175452,0.018629776,-0.03133551,0.016267031,-0.030254565,0.01975428,-0.023381095,0.017568754,0.03920253,-0.034209706,-0.013488116,-0.014101659,-0.009780399,-0.024339419,0.014730012,-0.0063561695,0.08153469,-0.020852657,-0.013880254,-0.019534118,-0.0318