c0edc4ef-4443-4a08-8a00-7410791fe45e.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày các kỹ thuật phục hồi cơ sở dữ liệu. Nó bao gồm các khái niệm về phục hồi, các phương pháp phục hồi khác nhau, từ phục hồi dựa trên nhật ký đến shadow paging. Đồng thời, tài liệu đề cập đến các kỹ thuật phục hồi nâng cao như ARIES và các phương pháp phục hồi trong môi trường đa cơ sở dữ liệu. Cuối cùng, nó còn thảo luận về sao lưu cơ sở dữ liệu và phục hồi sau các sự cố thảm khốc.	application/pdf	0	t	This chapter covers database recovery techniques, addressing non-catastrophic and catastrophic failures. It explores concepts like atomicity, consistency, and durability, along with methods such as deferred and immediate updates, shadow paging, and the ARIES algorithm. Key aspects include system logs, write-ahead logging, checkpoints, and recovery in multidatabase systems using two-phase commit.  The content also touches upon database backup strategies and recovery in Oracle environments, including RMAN and Flashback technology.	638d9df4-7553-4722-bd61-1e9efdd451e2		Bach khoa University	[0.038953684,0.04733205,-0.018005373,0.023737427,0.019974707,-0.03596123,-0.026908366,-0.044312052,0.024097431,0.03244788,0.010533226,0.006805469,0.111351565,0.062760904,-0.015894603,-0.040523943,0.007521516,-0.03234203,0.0310012,-0.0358564,0.038540177,-0.03107068,0.012443109,-0.020224953,0.011269004,-0.025747603,0.025619054,0.013418675,-0.01685891,0.06342336,0.022551594,-0.024831902,0.024217695,-0.006568616,0.03573743,0.009909825,0.005758108,-0.016890917,0.0032845333,0.02559526,0.0062946314,0.016258696,0.023251317,-0.02442243,0.034493424,-0.014278849,0.011319201,0.011259187,-0.028180635,-0.021318955,0.028985988,-0.0022781244,0.046646133,0.011497348,-0.019206056,-0.037967846,0.016838307,0.011209809,-0.030842056,0.030133868,-0.016612254,0.023130806,-0.0313761,0.036690723,0.03473577,-0.0052251546,-0.014610332,-0.04268072,-0.024766423,-0.0006977863,0.024734624,-0.02719383,0.08587144,-0.037068076,0.010145646,-0.024091415,-0.0436