b969f2f7-7c97-400b-af8a-49ac4571ce71.pdf	Tài liệu trình bày về các thuật toán và kỹ thuật liên quan đến xử lý và tối ưu hóa truy vấn trong hệ quản trị cơ sở dữ liệu. Nội dung bao gồm các khái niệm cơ bản, các bước xử lý truy vấn, các thuật toán sắp xếp, và các phương pháp tối ưu hóa. Đặc biệt, tài liệu tập trung vào việc tìm kiếm các kế hoạch thực thi hiệu quả nhất để truy vấn được thực hiện nhanh chóng và tiết kiệm chi phí nhất.	application/pdf	0	t	\N	0a90c721-053a-442e-80f3-70eb65c20a52		Bach khoa University	\N	\N	query-processing optimization algorithms database-systems sql	http://localhost:8888/api/v1/resource/download/asset/d986977e-f7aa-4839-a84a-7a4448df3490.png
c7ab720c-b501-42a4-8ac3-2b7b666d4009.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về việc sử dụng các mô hình Deep Learning trong Xử lý ngôn ngữ tự nhiên (NLP) để phân tích cảm xúc. Bài giảng tập trung vào các kiến trúc CNN và RNN, đặc biệt trong bài toán phân tích cảm xúc. Nội dung bao gồm các khái niệm về Convolution, Pooling, và các kỹ thuật như Dropout để cải thiện hiệu suất. Cuối cùng, tài liệu cũng đề cập đến kiến trúc phức tạp hơn và các ứng dụng thực tế.	application/pdf	0	t	This lecture explores the application of Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) and Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs) for sentiment analysis in Natural Language Processing (NLP). It covers CNNs for feature extraction, including the use of filters, ReLU activation, and pooling layers. The lecture also delves into the architecture of CNNs, including hyperparameters, word vectors, and dropout techniques. Furthermore, it discusses sentiment analysis at various levels (document, sentence, aspect) and explores machine learning approaches like topic modeling, emphasizing the extraction of aspect-related opinions.	f9687b4c-1d67-4033-833f-872d1556bc16		Bach khoa University	[0.0025866907,0.054227024,0.00979718,0.030414818,0.0080073085,-0.06736347,-0.020426648,-0.02780141,0.05233986,0.06652786,0.015876839,0.003051622,0.11976434,0.078508645,-0.033999093,-0.0508199,0.01922706,-0.019977422,0.034597665,-0.050225604,0.025042983,-0.065635756,0.006704544,0.0068877894,0.021145009,-0.015266968,0.027573824,0.0032546355,-0.009005533,0.061523393,0.05048597,-0.034312338,0.01798964,0.028918657,0.042407133,-0.004959609,-0.00870674,-0.037998524,0.001450374,0.029112954,0.03936224,0.0294666,0.050575417,-0.05087685,0.032820143,-0.0077423416,0.045225125,0.0017760972,-0.020482102,-0.004997337,0.032432865,-0.0053749382,0.021758398,0.013532657,-0.011754086,-0.033824198,0.011831694,0.044653933,-0.010109707,0.06702889,-0.00670268,0.031901933,-0.011572623,0.014955471,0.048077293,-0.0063681854,-0.0063150716,-0.040893346,-0.011389306,-0.018058892,