ropoutp =0.5\nL2 constraint s for rows of softmax s =3\nMini batch size for SGD training: 50\nWord vectors: pre-trained with word2vec, k = 300\nDuring training, keep checking performance on dev set and pick highest accuracy weights for final evaluation\nS5 có thiết kết bắt mắt nhưng camera không được nét lắm\nKNOWLEDGE BASE\n\n\n=== [BẢNG SỐ LIỆU] ===\nTerm bắt mắt nét 0.75 xấu - 0.75 tệ hại - 0.75\n======================\nSentiment Dictionary\nSENTIMENT ENGINE\n\n\n=== [BẢNG SỐ LIỆU] ===\nAction Pattern “không được” Lấy phản nghĩa của A A A “không A: positive bằng” B B: negative\n======================\n<Domain> Smartphone </> <Brand> Samsung</> <Product> S5, Note4 </> <Attribute> “thiết kế”, “camera”</> Domain Ontology\nPattern Rules\nSentiment Analysis\n• Infer sentiment orientation/opinion in a document (Liu, 2012)\n• Three levels:\n– Document level\n– Sentence level\n– Aspect level\nChoosing parameters\n• https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.09820.pdf\nAspect-based Sentiment Analysis\nS5 has a nice design but its camera does not offer very high resolution\nSubject: S5 (neutral)\n--- Design (+)\n--- Camera: (-)\nSENTIMENT ENGINE\nMachine Learning Approaches\n• Topic Modeling\n– Extraction of aspect-related opinion works (Qiu et.al, 2013)\n– Probabilistic Latent Semantic Analysis (PLSA) for aspect and opinion modeling (Mei et. al., 2007)\n– Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) (Li, 2010; Zhao,2010; Sauper,2011; Mukherjee, 2012)\nDeep Learning Approaches\n• Introduced by LeCun (1989), improved by Hilton (1990)\n– Standford Treebank and Stanford NLP using RNN (Pang,2005; Manning,2014; Socher, 2013)\n– CNN approach (Kim,2014)\n– LSTM approach (Wang,2016)\n• Automatic recognition of “hidden features”\n• Performing very well with document and sentence levels\nMore sophisticated architecture\n	deep-learning nlp cnn rnn sentiment-analysis	http://localhost:8888/api/v1/resource/download/asset/57b5012e-0a12-4074-aa63-551aced3bbcd.png
01efc123-ba69-43a0-aa35-1cced4308d6c.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về các kiểu dữ liệu trong lập trình. Nó bao gồm các khái niệm về hệ thống kiểu dữ liệu, các loại dữ liệu cơ bản như số, boolean và các loại dữ liệu phức tạp hơn như mảng, chuỗi, bản ghi và con trỏ. Tài liệu cũng đề cập đến các khía cạnh khác nhau như kiểm tra kiểu, kiểu tương đương và tính tương thích. Cuối cùng, một ví dụ về các kiểu dữ liệu trong Python được đưa ra.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides a comprehensive overview of data types in programming, including scalar, composite, and user-defined types. It explores type checking, type equivalence, and type compatibility. Specific types like arrays, strings, records, unions, pointers, and references are discussed, along with their characteristics and implementations. The document also includes a case study on Python, detailing its data structures like lists, tuples, dictionaries, and sets, and introduces concepts like list comprehension.	77dec9ab-c7f2-4a83-b0e0-2a807b53cdd5		Bach khoa University	[0.008181061,0.06753461,-0.010774478,0.034570727,0.011411687,-0.02919146,-0.0069203,-0.038618546,0.0055882684,0.027036816,-0.010114912,0.008810563,0.08247224,0.013232902,-0.021951156,-0.057650864,0.00075657194,-0.009600271,0.026116384,0.0057749483,0.04902694,-0.015316812,0.034934573,-0.027343431,0.0029840479,-0.017806396,0.05178643,0.012589787,-0.003247015,0.06715038,0.021247348,-0.02051355,0.038090616,0.05910172,0.02483418,0.0076941657,0.0150635615,-0.019821035,0.021436831,0.021732204,0.04545874,0.022390267,0.021324815,-0.036776353,0.026405139,-0.030183883,0.03149658,0.013774136,-0.016748881,-0.043746416,0.044894256,0.018711526,0.037875753,0.020950194,-0.049338937,-0.03008956,0.009227805,0.017231803,-0.024015075,0.021997849,-0.00486274,0.011304488,-0.008610036,0.059972838,0.051525254,-0.017906297,0.0130180735,-0.03806414,-0.008086753,-0.015552872,-0.0020228298,-0.028300676,0.073075466,-0.038197495,-0.02586787,-0.0043357657,-0.01241784,0.03952586,0.01