40974843-701d-4374-ac47-89d7e8e61578.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về học sâu, tập trung vào mạng nơ-ron truyền thẳng (deep feedforward networks). Nội dung bao gồm các khái niệm về mạng sâu, phương pháp học dựa trên gradient, các hàm chi phí, các đơn vị đầu ra và các đơn vị ẩn. Bài viết cũng đề cập đến thiết kế kiến trúc mạng và giải thuật lan truyền ngược (back-propagation).	application/pdf	0	t	This document explores key concepts in Deep Learning, focusing on Deep Feedforward Networks. It covers gradient-based learning, cost functions, and output units such as linear, sigmoid, and softmax.  Hidden units, including ReLU and Maxout, are discussed, along with architectural design considerations and the importance of depth. The Back-Propagation algorithm for computing gradients is explained.	92e574bb-70ad-4fe5-bdf3-cefa4d71d53a		Bach khoa University	[0.0008348512,0.059260815,0.0042405943,0.023177637,0.02180796,-0.08994069,-0.019723017,-0.039874047,0.03409456,0.05091542,-0.0050328104,-0.0017003444,0.14256203,0.08425815,-0.037961137,-0.06740262,0.008114319,-0.016242154,0.051334463,-0.023383355,0.04531797,-0.047424175,0.034398396,-0.03267407,0.034792323,-0.016226895,0.027742902,0.024896055,-0.008490938,0.07109538,0.04517378,-0.0365789,0.022185456,0.03191916,0.039994888,0.025632104,-0.0063124686,-0.06266559,0.004529003,0.04659039,-0.0018552428,0.02116692,0.046125613,-0.05820352,0.04045487,-0.0022408932,0.028723275,-0.014173172,-0.032298513,-0.021788903,0.030371215,0.0118112825,0.03289666,0.028093318,-0.013442413,-0.02790942,0.019785704,0.055472944,-0.03160361,0.04619669,-0.024080882,0.045101166,0.0053320583,0.017050995,0.034882728,-0.012513174,0.030229509,-0.054407842,-0.01801676,-0.029407771,-0.0036536749,-0.018194133,0.072027296,-0.05750195,-0.006621639,-0.031156931,-0.03745509,0.03591756,0.026331829,-0.005718629,0.028910499,0.010948246,0.026196847,0.029676005,0.0026854107,0.000581838,-0.033785775,0.021203008,0.037866518,0.048046537,0.028865227,-0.020196185,-0.07354823,0.03