892e19c5-543a-42b1-98b5-93dd93194b68.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về Deep Learning và các ứng dụng của nó. Đặc biệt, tài liệu tập trung vào các khái niệm về mạng lưới thần kinh hồi quy (RNN), bao gồm các kiến trúc như RNN hai chiều (Bidirectional RNNs) và kiến trúc Encoder-Decoder. Bên cạnh đó, các thuật toán như Back-propagation through time (BPTT) cũng được đề cập. Cuối cùng, một trong những cấu trúc tiên tiến là The Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) cũng được giới thiệu.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides an overview of Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs), covering topics such as unfolding computational graphs, different RNN architectures (Bidirectional, Encoder-Decoder), and the Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) variant. It discusses training techniques like teacher forcing, backpropagation through time, and methods for handling long-term dependencies. The document also touches upon recursive neural networks and their potential benefits, along with applications like machine translation and image captioning, and highlights the advantages of LSTMs for learning long-term dependencies. Different types of gates within LSTM are explained and how optimization and regularization are applied.	38c47e28-7dc0-409d-a2e8-9760914fd149		Bach khoa University	[0.0076318313,0.047433008,0.004921905,0.030299101,0.024642777,-0.06488792,-0.028850662,-0.05327168,0.02340597,0.04855291,-0.027959796,0.0010993228,0.13112079,0.07733931,-0.04076376,-0.040646363,0.026108498,-0.03166091,0.040022086,-0.007980455,0.052852068,-0.049429342,0.01824683,-0.015245258,0.012662169,-0.028982215,0.020103246,0.041344985,9.703366e-05,0.036417685,0.04755691,-0.02612767,0.005140711,0.020309418,0.041748427,0.00080333464,-0.012423261,-0.048553053,0.008121171,0.04559732,0.015497299,0.007802675,0.03886521,-0.05757504,0.030022,-0.002288798,0.032044843,-0.0054261303,-0.027164957,-0.028945878,0.046960086,0.014719445,0.044477966,0.024559796,-0.035849553,-0.02466203,0.020849638,0.042009037,-0.04096834,0.026269585,-0.0281966