b10ddc53-dd1f-40e2-86ac-274cbead8524.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về phương pháp Support Vector Machine (SVM) trong lĩnh vực học máy. SVM là một phương pháp phân loại dựa trên việc tìm kiếm biên lớn nhất giữa các lớp dữ liệu. Tài liệu cũng giới thiệu về khái niệm kernel trick để xử lý dữ liệu không phân tách tuyến tính, và soft-margin SVM cho phép sai số khi phân loại.	application/pdf	0	t	The document explores the concepts of Support Vector Machines (SVMs) within the context of Machine Learning. It delves into topics such as analytical geometry, maximum margin classifiers, and the use of Lagrange multipliers for optimization. The discussion includes handling non-linearly separable data through the kernel trick, introducing concepts like feature spaces and kernel functions. Soft-margin SVMs are also discussed, addressing the issue of allowing for misclassified samples using slack variables and penalty terms.	4fc43288-1960-4b98-9a99-23e8866706cc		Bach khoa University	[0.0073823673,0.05777706,-0.0138798915,0.03452899,0.05463369,-0.067899,-0.030834856,-0.004052361,0.009381655,-0.009915487,-0.020186909,0.01404106,0.14253601,0.06312472,-0.035332028,-0.04371434,0.016962893,-0.02564506,0.052529205,-0.011194501,0.058795795,-0.02861743,0.01962576,0.0018102645,0.012335352,-0.010002955,0.024910554,0.009314454,-0.014113735,0.085171014,0.042044196,-0.015096994,0.028467413,0.04116495,0.03736979,-0.008911231,0.021661224,-0.029538406,0.0054387297,0.02954689,0.005913973,0.029447602,0.017016334,-0.03842063,0.017544808,-0.02459372,0.043235082,0.005247441,-0.015914515,-0.012792479,0.022674387,-0.0005805698,0.041242257,0.04030453,-0.022349065,-0.03697118,0.005350499,0.028910445,-0.05306241,0.021398153,-0.017083365,0.03134142,0.00803111,0.04911783,0.030863794,-0.05550764,0.0041619395,-0.043450307,-0.023758767,-0.04509331,0.026757857,-0.017750401,0.07693058,-0.021397246,-0.035244502,0.018614514,-0.049491797,0.036818407,0.0035727697,-0.006013763,0.03201003,0.007684235,0.017710576,0.027090097,