7d607072-66df-450b-9bf4-ac0785f4f247.pdf	Tài liệu này giới thiệu về Mạng nơ-ron tích chập (CNNs), một loại mạng nơ-ron chuyên biệt để xử lý dữ liệu có cấu trúc lưới. Nó giải thích các khái niệm cốt lõi như phép tích chập và pooling, cũng như động lực đằng sau việc sử dụng CNNs, bao gồm tương tác thưa thớt và chia sẻ tham số. Bên cạnh đó, tài liệu đề cập đến một số loại dữ liệu và cấu trúc đầu ra mà CNNs có thể xử lý, cũng như phân tích các kiến trúc phổ biến như AlexNet, VGGNet và GoogLeNet.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides an overview of Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs), a specialized type of neural network. It covers various aspects like convolution operations, pooling, different variants of convolution functions, and the challenges of CNNs. The document also presents different network architectures like AlexNet, VGGNet and GoogLeNet, analyzing their features, parameters, and performance. The concepts of parameter sharing, sparse interactions and equivariance are explained as well.	34c53bc9-44cb-4ad6-863a-a5779389bf60		Bach khoa University	[0.027339963,0.061991494,0.004687093,0.026692918,0.026428197,-0.06721733,-0.018079944,-0.016814886,0.045175746,0.027241392,0.02352198,-0.0037754804,0.11358052,0.06882829,-0.035977084,-0.06363123,0.030719208,-0.00892738,0.041137833,-0.013700195,0.02379487,-0.016476814,0.048686445,0.0005371104,0.02001345,-0.023430558,0.017887993,0.02459286,-0.04668642,0.059827343,0.032916855,-0.036320955,-0.0012854347,0.041101076,0.048965875,0.0023914075,-0.008791423,-0.037480507,0.029418387,0.02934517,0.022076147,0.03557041,0.055846665,-0.038753986,0.01891546,-0.0056528402,0.04241695,0.007005691,-0.03734617,-0.02644438,0.03985498,-0.011106954,-0.0018894436,0.022507839,-0.013872223,-0.03186109,0.025567658,0.052283444,-0.025001163,0.075005375,-0.010355175,0.012186649,0.0025994305,0.037945855,0.057997335,-0.00064892665,0.018827375,-0.044171415,-0.017555773,-0.017708048,0.0053822133,-0.05158158,0.068548635,-0.050910577,-0.025847342,-0.00