f6ff128a-187e-43f5-8231-281ae5d36efe.pdf	Tài liệu kiểm tra về phát triển ứng dụng IoT, bao gồm các câu hỏi về kiến thức liên quan đến mạng, giao thức, và các thành phần trong hệ thống IoT. Các câu hỏi tập trung vào giao tiếp, kết nối, xử lý dữ liệu, và ứng dụng. Đặc biệt, có những câu hỏi về MQTT, một giao thức truyền thông quan trọng trong IoT.	application/pdf	0	t	Phân tích kỹ thuật sử dụng các chỉ báo và công cụ để dự đoán biến động giá. Bao gồm các khái niệm như đường trung bình động, MACD, RSI, Fibonacci, hỗ trợ và kháng cự, mô hình nến và biểu đồ, quản lý rủi ro và các chiến lược giao dịch khác nhau.	6cc6630a-4bed-413e-919a-3fc5451e4fdb		Bach khoa University	[0.037360117,0.07291606,-0.022676658,0.03129846,0.015569319,-0.06706771,-0.036424093,-0.02047812,-0.009566969,0.01747424,0.01550114,0.032441974,0.15426019,0.067672044,-0.020037351,-0.050659217,-0.0059334887,-0.014959907,0.04089472,-0.014578872,0.05961935,-0.04084765,0.034368463,0.016061943,0.048435997,-0.013608797,0.01644055,0.01879914,-0.017242517,0.015415771,0.009453158,-0.020691877,-0.028684443,0.029573211,0.04169387,0.030120183,-0.000112300004,-0.014804068,0.049141575,0.016744167,0.0021602688,0.054840744,0.034974813,-0.036527365,0.015465105,-0.015659507,0.03098837,0.00015035123,-0.0023478332,-0.004046425,0.03658467,0.0343027,0.08257657,0.016154936,-0.06229978,-0.035889078,0.021044958,0.023487514,-4.5944067e-05,0.029103514,0.0077037304,0.021778902,-0.017186327,0.054954007,0.02432723,-0.044434953,0.004356067,-0.014354421,-0.04330355,-0.024557794,0.019599576,-0.018645672,0.1080069,-0.033431377,-0.0073173083,0.0015114667,-0.07204297,0.026015775,0.0054518157,-0.029259263,0.032776546,0.0013929177,-0.028948823,0.062031984,0.030643357,-0.011150178,-0.025047584,0.02953624,0.017724006,0.031202683,0.053878948,-0.012659883,-0.009875896,0.020842727,0.021791195,0.016353033,0.03763116,0.013729392,0.024418738,-0.07384485,-0.035237413,-0.029314708,-0.012765426,-0.03034223,-0.037308548,-0.00935846,-0.03764738,-0.02628803