17d7b880-088d-4dad-9b17-c5df86c626e0.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về JVM (Java Virtual Machine) và Jasmin. Nó bao gồm các khái niệm về trình biên dịch, Java bytecode, và các lệnh của Jasmin. Ngoài ra, tài liệu còn đề cập đến cấu trúc bên trong của JVM và các loại dữ liệu được sử dụng trong Java.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides an overview of the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) and Jasmin, a Java assembler. It covers the JVM's architecture, including data types, operand stack, local variable arrays, and various instructions. The document also delves into Jasmin directives, method invocation, and provides examples of code generation and bytecode manipulation. It also touches on concepts like method return and field instructions.	7c88a65b-1e7d-4551-ac3a-91c61d6dfc0e		Bach khoa University	[0.015604893,0.037070226,0.005379734,0.025533896,0.036529616,-0.007904119,-0.013411826,-0.013408516,0.008465032,-0.02239758,-0.0016129438,0.019172605,0.10928388,0.047987215,-0.039435886,-0.04082826,-0.0004259438,-0.017444896,0.03813696,0.00636452,0.0073091676,-0.026349023,0.012690772,-0.02035552,0.009490135,-0.029721802,0.05311425,0.02454131,-0.046110243,0.035988342,0.053666767,-0.012567542,0.034858942,0.056786112,0.014586864,0.022013295,-0.041223545,-0.019583775,0.002728088,0.007263403,0.032230932,0.032611195,0.01603018,-0.027677424,0.012424163,-0.008684182,0.06246758,0.0027206468,-0.0087199975,-0.026920998,0.036770955,-0.0025505675,0.0247716,0.022980813,-0.052351784,-0.028520769,0.022314511,0.057610244,-0.04438979,0.04224864,-0.019145882,0.033636604,-0.029739514,0.0150411455,0.032869212,-0.029327637,-0.015899867,-0.021418583,-0.013879225,-0.014761489,0.018510545,-0.011970334,0.045970846,-0.008753321,-0.027713148,-0.0014993516,-0.03213909,0.014900436,0.0065215663,-0.017884815,0.046980344,-0.008767643,-0.0020901482,0.03555031,0.047762334,0.0064359508,-0.018002557,0.027636789,0.028170185,0.014950829,0.024841523,-0.04674469,-0.05720464,0.086102016,0.01662323,0.005610791,0.017154563,0.