516001c4-5c2c-4642-b6d6-6e772594b0ce.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về phân tích cảm xúc đa phương thức, kết hợp hình ảnh và văn bản. Tác giả giới thiệu ba phương pháp tổng hợp để giải quyết vấn đề phân tích cảm xúc trên dữ liệu đa mô hình. Thí nghiệm được thực hiện trên các mô hình CNN được huấn luyện trước để trích xuất các đặc trưng hình ảnh. Kết quả cho thấy mô hình kết hợp BERT, DenseNet201 và Hybrid Fusion cho kết quả tốt nhất.	application/pdf	0	t	This research focuses on multimodal sentiment analysis, specifically combining text and images for sentiment analysis. It explores multimodal applications like retrieval, captioning, and classification. The study proposes three fusion methods (Intermediate, Late, and Hybrid) for integrating text and image data. Experiments were conducted using various pre-trained models, with DenseNet201 and BERT found to be effective. The research utilizes datasets like MVSA-Single and MVSA-Multiple, and employs techniques like SMOTE for data balancing. The results showcase the effectiveness of the proposed fusion models, particularly Hybrid Fusion, in improving sentiment analysis accuracy. Future directions include focusing on feature-level data connection, applying attention mechanisms, and addressing imbalanced labels.	e63ee509-42f4-42ab-8756-5a79a6a31bc2		Bach khoa University	[0.042702097,0.04055083,-0.011500764,0.044665933,0.020690603,-0.097459875,-0.034127764,-0.01568754,0.036023617,0.038460832,-0.008260706,0.010322415,0.13088864,0.06307451,-0.023175318,-0.06536994,0.015184648,-0.01863345,0.040810023,-0.042848933,0.019081915,-0.04300988,0.055087704,-0.015421939,0.015123605,-0.009942725,-0.0006641434,0.012355868,-0.013840892,0.08213381,0.03156906,-0.0147293545,0.022546623,0.057863276,0.054842584,0.009658942,0.0027474212,-0.04053604,-0.00020702023,0.054686673,0.047113467,0.0011199077,0.025487944,-0.031844705,0.022260673,-0.017751347,0.015419407,0.014477883,-0.033912964,-0.032431707,0.02781005,0.018727018,0.03319742,0.035578907,-0.03