5d686924-c8e1-4be1-879c-9f5ca598418b.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về kiến trúc Seq2Seq và cơ chế Attention trong lĩnh vực xử lý ngôn ngữ tự nhiên (NLP). Seq2Seq là một kiến trúc đặc biệt bao gồm 2 thành phần chính: Encoder và Decoder, được sử dụng để xử lý các tác vụ như dịch máy. Attention là một cơ chế giúp Decoder tập trung vào các phần quan trọng của chuỗi đầu vào, giải quyết vấn đề nghẽn cổ chai trong các mô hình RNN.	application/pdf	0	t	This document analyzes NLP architectures and mechanisms, primarily focusing on RNN, Seq2Seq, and the Attention mechanism. It explains the components of Seq2Seq (Encoder, Decoder) and the training technique 'Teacher Forcing'. The Attention mechanism is highlighted as a solution to the bottleneck problem in sequence-to-sequence models, improving tasks like machine translation by focusing on relevant parts of the input sequence. Different types of attention (local/global, hard/soft) are mentioned.	3d93c9c5-f61a-4bef-8ba0-761f00fadb25		Bach khoa University	[0.0068152444,0.040518757,0.00046955998,0.019784851,0.041714728,-0.08754257,-0.020136427,-0.030901952,0.022700839,0.035156235,-0.0066492083,-0.010045863,0.098199025,0.07181948,-0.036560036,-0.07134413,0.00861148,-0.019873595,0.037071176,-0.0075079505,0.04254418,-0.056581967,0.014523066,-0.013635971,0.0204348,-0.020596132,0.024632448,0.01409678,0.010195602,0.03905054,0.040837508,-0.027831092,0.0362738,0.029999394,0.056352403,-0.00039810952,-0.017821724,-0.035089012,0.033678763,0.027136138,0.031025035,0.001493732,0.042479936,-0.02565334,0.02751844,-0.014253103,0.021846185,0.012498921,-0.041850958,-0.0460125,0.05007994,0.024125904,0.048892926,-0.023628851,-0.062183432,-0.029492404,0.02576052,0.043146018,-0.03964936,0.045861196,-0.0075702593,0.04593106,-0.011737592,0.035128318,0.04604966,-0.03330253,-0.00272667,-0.032817453,-0.0090443855,-0.0070116716,0.012860521,-0.030389452,0.08258964,-0.062384624,-0.016575066,0.019351255,-0.025209714,0.021960657,0.017092586,-0.028475467,0.053398207,