a: on each step of the decoder, we attend the current token to focus on a particular part of the sequence\n- Attention helps solve the bottleneck problem of LSTM and GRU\nSequence-to-sequence: the bottleneck problem\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\n— NNY Joq\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\n— NNY Joq\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\n— NNY Joq\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\n— NNY Joq\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nUse the attention distribution to take a weighted sum of the encoder hidden states.\nThe attention output mostly contains information from the hidden states that received high attention.\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nD\nNNY 49p02\nN\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nSometimes we take the attention output from the previous step, and also feed it into the decoder (along with the usual decoder input). We do this in Assignment 4.\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nD\nNNY Joq\nN\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nD\nNNY Joq\nN\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nD\nNNY Joq\nN\nSequence-to-sequence with attention\nD\nNNY p0(Q\nN\nAttention mechanism\n- Attention could be divided based on various criteria:\n1) Region\n● Local attention\n● Global attention\nAttention mechanism\n- Attention could be divided based on various criteria:\n1) Region\n● Local attention\n● Global attention\n2) Method\n● Hard attention\n● Soft attention\nSoft Attention\nSummary\n1) Seq2Seq architecture is great\n2)Attention seems complicated, but fun to apply for tasks in real life like text summarization, machine translation, etc.\nReferences\n1)[Thang Luong et al. 2015] Effective Approaches to Attention-based Neural Machine Translation. EMNLP 2015.\n2)[Sutskever et al. 2014] Sequence to sequence learning with\nneural networks. In NIPS.\n3) [d2l.ai] Dive into Deep Learning\n	seq2seq attention rnn encoder decoder	http://localhost:8888/api/v1/resource/download/asset/ca780d90-0d80-4d7f-bb25-904df4e57c1c.png
98d38764-4184-486d-97d1-8b7e77ad7ced.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về Deep Learning trong Xử lý Ngôn ngữ Tự nhiên. Nó tập trung vào mạng nơ-ron sâu và Word Embedding, bao gồm các khái niệm cơ bản và các ứng dụng. Tài liệu cũng đề cập đến các kỹ thuật để biểu diễn văn bản và mô hình Word2vec như CBOW, giúp cải thiện khả năng xử lý và hiểu ngôn ngữ.	application/pdf	0	t	This document covers deep learning for natural language processing, including neural networks, word embeddings, and specific architectures like CNN and Autoencoders. It explores classical machine learning techniques, housing price prediction examples, and circuit theory related to deep learning. It details word embedding methods, including SVD and word2vec, along with the CBOW and Skip-gram models, and discusses word analogies.	4b7d50a4-7c59-47b9-b3b3-4a09cf183ba5		Bach khoa University	[0.019093743,0.06839749,0.01134392,0.030535769,0.036640406,-0.037853457,-0.025081564,-0.02889391,0.03837094,0.03442588,-7.472958e-05,-0.0069076098,0.11908738,0.06181573,-0.03148612,-0.0420911,0.009150026,-0.01889119,0.0563817,-0.017271876,0.034637377,-0.05258308,0.07004825,0.0012164824,0.015195772,-0.020346837,0.018492559,0.04052091,-0.017570741,0.08121489,0.03513466,-0.028865606,0.021006595,0.029813219,0.03222194,-0.0076004653,-0.0031188924,-0.045301326,-0.0013309178,0.048772328,0.0010068282,0.03237914,0.01943814,-0.048437793,0.043315694,-0.008044811,0.045437574,0.014096711,-0.026463302,-0.023381002,0.042485885,-0.0022979425,0.029540483,0.014384555,-0.030249747,-0.017607758,0.019644052,0.04571383,-0.020037642,0.030049197,-0.024400232,0.02579227,-0.023563363,0.039054353,0.04826115,-0.031436656,-0.017076746,-0.056083933,-0.021277271,-0.043782093,0.005462847,-0.04328753,0.07011308,-0.0469081,-0.009949429,-0.0040096277,-0.01601259,0.0495645,0.025156986,-0.0070340377,0.035797946,0.027797053,0.010339524,0.01990788,0.021348968,-0.023100225,-0.036019757,0.036643516,0.025501702,0.02580107,0.0073306644,-0.005636463,-0.048825633,0.015