5cb11e30-b66e-4016-a267-dd962f8c15e5.pdf	Tài liệu này giới thiệu về trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI), bao gồm các khái niệm, định nghĩa và lịch sử phát triển. Nó đề cập đến các khía cạnh khác nhau của AI, từ việc suy luận và giải quyết vấn đề đến học máy và ứng dụng trong các lĩnh vực khác nhau. Tài liệu cũng trình bày về các vấn đề cơ bản và các bài toán điển hình trong lĩnh vực AI, đồng thời đưa ra cái nhìn tổng quan về trạng thái phát triển hiện tại của AI.	application/pdf	0	t	This document introduces Artificial Intelligence (AI), covering introductory problems, problem-solving through search, heuristic search, game playing, planning, knowledge representation, reasoning, uncertainty, machine learning, and various AI applications. It explores different approaches to AI, including acting humanly (Turing Test), thinking humanly (cognitive modeling), thinking rationally (logic), and acting rationally (rational agent).  The document also mentions example problems and the state of the art in AI, including robotics, speech recognition, and game playing.	9c21a370-cc72-4fa4-9a2c-353f143d7bd6		Bach khoa University	[0.011047322,0.036143076,-0.012143263,0.01109593,0.052425187,-0.06443565,-0.014599594,-0.04463004,0.03614494,0.04658898,-0.008085877,8.793382e-05,0.14236525,0.04120818,-0.03502244,-0.04639559,0.010576312,-0.017273279,0.015321264,0.006697642,0.040068172,-0.031308405,0.011035269,-0.03268585,0.0040038805,-0.029853303,0.040425155,0.041394938,-0.013025642,0.053522345,0.037048385,-0.025379024,0.026111469,0.027542915,0.019220991,0.0018416711,-0.0006733602,-0.022420684,0.028212707,0.049735468,0.045128703,0.017143298,0.027215995,-0.05270834,0.037052378,-0.008362199,0.032595996,-0.0055026608,-0.0020718195,-0.039171197,0.042235292,0.013541457,0.0327012,0.032108948,-0.014962545,-0.052216228,0.018708978,0.00901282,-0.0027405093,0.045089167,-0.000594346,0.014378342,-0.010081563,0.028048772,0.056758787,-0.037519857,0.008837499,-0.048350956,-0.01958268,-0.015789757,0.013254791,-0.020470243