da5ce062-0dda-4036-a999-c12cebd6c78e.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày các khái niệm về kiến thức có cấu trúc, bao gồm Logic Notation, Semantic Nets, Frames, Conceptual Graphs và Ontology. Nội dung tập trung vào cách biểu diễn kiến thức và các phương pháp thể hiện logic. Ngoài ra, tài liệu còn đề cập đến các dạng biểu diễn như existential graphs và các quy tắc suy luận trong chúng. Cuối cùng, nó trình bày về ontology và các ứng dụng của nó.	application/pdf	0	t	This document explores various logic notations and knowledge representation methods. It covers Frege's Begriffsschrift, algebraic notation by Peirce, and Peano's notation. Existential Graphs, Semantic Nets, Frames, and Conceptual Graphs are also discussed. The document highlights the evolution of these concepts, including rules of inference, the structure of semantic nets, the use of frames, and the integration of concepts in hybrid systems and conceptual graphs. Furthermore, it introduces the concept of ontology and its role in structuring knowledge.	8f0f3985-cace-4485-981e-6ade44e0950d		Bach khoa University	[0.002776965,0.032072105,-0.011111505,0.054985125,0.030815521,-0.0453355,-0.022542747,-0.043664023,0.017824596,0.05729988,-0.021188686,-0.028239692,0.104738146,0.03778392,-0.017201371,-0.05973227,0.0063983034,-0.025433512,0.034906674,-0.03881032,0.04630992,-0.034980208,0.032901496,0.0038676653,-0.006849454,-0.011325234,0.016192876,0.031793896,0.0037179769,0.08198832,0.03957112,-0.039998073,0.027561583,0.03614236,0.03775434,0.0030339237,-0.017312612,-0.015883723,0.04154446,0.0475386,0.027401613,0.019971726,0.03973962,-0.043099504,0.027824897,-0.0010735651,0.027435603,0.028034585,0.002013527,-0.02435187,0.03170751,0.0269779,0.027427122,0.040552653,-0.026036112,-0.023634993,0.011508567,0.0025825535,-0.06365975,0.032136593,-0.0004114388,0.03449695,-0.03136304,0.020241667,-0.008586229,-0.02616759,-0.010203144,-0.02133445,0.02115465,-0.0341899,-0.0022142476,0.0037596861,0.06476471,-0.039393842,-0.0056316433,-0.0137589