a262d4fb-ee5a-4450-9082-7658c82dd35e.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về Logic trong lĩnh vực trí tuệ nhân tạo, bắt đầu với Logic mệnh đề và chuyển sang Logic vị từ. Nội dung tập trung vào cách biểu diễn tri thức, bao gồm cả đối tượng và định lượng, cùng với các khái niệm về suy luận và giải quyết. Cuối cùng, tài liệu giới thiệu về cách thức hoạt động của Prolog.	application/pdf	0	t	The document explores propositional and predicate logic, focusing on knowledge representation and reasoning. It covers topics like converting logical statements to clause form, resolution, unification, and Skolemization. The content includes examples, the use of PROLOG, and the challenges associated with these logical systems, such as ambiguity, incomplete search, and the occur-check.	29f766a2-de8d-43dc-9c79-d8304de2ea91		Bach khoa University	[0.019486561,0.044801403,-0.018537754,0.0426446,0.04115293,-0.051297743,-0.014987652,-0.044152115,0.038838465,0.042290572,-0.0012193249,-0.0027888946,0.06578209,0.039765183,-0.0077892547,-0.054349463,0.015529892,-0.009619236,0.047432948,-0.0065155085,0.025758054,-0.027948152,0.054623142,-0.01519297,-0.0057542413,-0.010846466,0.04060789,0.03514163,-0.006760185,0.08930275,0.03255996,-0.0034006033,0.03428289,0.0041807904,0.030866971,0.0017077029,-0.027685285,-0.03882185,0.03162613,0.033283867,0.019733978,0.004249774,-0.0054077334,-0.052792676,0.036748953,-0.02603764,0.026921583,0.018524578,-0.019995784,-0.032387257,0.040859394,0.0037006547,0.02778107,0.034474105,-0.036190614,-0.02531328,0.024629898,0.0035926818,-0.048218194,0.044521026,0.009718859,0.014351519,-0.020614924,0.038160015,0.0104295,-0.023729898,0.02596197,-0.019624112,0.021956675,-0.009881248,-0.00511499,-0.02754845,0.075110406,-0.03499316,-0.025998801,-0.0048021832,-0.028412601,0.020370033,0.009052798,-0.001737961,0.04337919,0.04389667,0.0088472385,0.020479184,0.02066967,0.0049500396,-0.024477975,0.036919102,0.045883607,0.04126807,0.038875233,-0.017322348,-0.011170086,0.058040176,0.040432308,0.0