ed703540-0a50-48e0-a170-e7ce9ecc09bb.pdf	Tài liệu này trình bày về khái niệm và ứng dụng của cây quyết định (Decision Tree) trong lĩnh vực học máy.  Nội dung bao gồm giới thiệu về cây quyết định, thuật toán ID3, các khái niệm như entropy và Gain Ratio, cùng với các phương pháp xử lý dữ liệu đặc biệt như thuộc tính số và giá trị bị thiếu. Ngoài ra, tài liệu còn đề cập đến các kỹ thuật để ngăn chặn hiện tượng overfitting và các ứng dụng của cây quyết định cho bài toán hồi quy.	application/pdf	0	t	The document provides a comprehensive overview of Decision Trees, covering algorithms like ID3 and C4.5, attribute selection, entropy, information gain, and gain ratio. It also explores handling numeric and missing values, pruning techniques, and regression problems. The content delves into various aspects of decision tree learning, including practical considerations for industrial applications and the use of Gini index.	60d1223e-b0f3-4827-ab6a-c37ab24674f3		Bach khoa University	[0.01459666,0.07770176,-0.013282457,0.015863722,0.025049109,-0.0843008,0.002545916,-0.015648982,0.052982546,0.051221695,-0.0035378307,0.03557744,0.10315207,0.06695331,-0.022940394,-0.049845275,0.00932696,-0.012324462,0.04395083,-0.028602779,0.03389222,-0.015431574,0.046640325,-0.019610843,0.029541036,-0.031351015,0.014413002,0.05587845,-0.040092032,0.04364164,0.03261324,-0.022350304,0.028799528,0.017663471,0.030105889,0.048320085,-0.01607399,-0.026911873,-0.0069284253,0.046045575,0.04685748,0.016958196,0.03209212,-0.03620191,0.012277661,-0.032816805,0.05479419,0.0011679305,-0.005046799,-0.051431436,0.048793424,0.024264209,0.02161765,0.02697477,-0.0673653,-0.024241038,0.015572919,0.026525036,-0.026848659,0.03467516,-0.012424693,0.04360565,-0.02448958,0.013160845,0.055624034,-0.040683486,0.018277062,-0.041526858,-0.009588828,-0.025507798,0.027561348,-0.036903117,0.061288305,-0.061738558,-0.030588329,-0.0088550635,-0.033276573,0.026833858,0.0050920295,-0.020195652,0.027811553,0.017009307,-0.011275583,0.0