913594ea-50aa-454d-b173-5442debc165d.pdf	Tài liệu trình bày về quá trình triển khai phần mềm, bao gồm các khái niệm về triển khai, phong cách viết mã và các tiêu chuẩn liên quan. Đồng thời, nó đề cập đến việc tích hợp các thành phần phần mềm và quá trình kiểm thử, cũng như các nguyên tắc và yếu tố quan trọng trong phát triển phần mềm, từ việc xem xét các yêu cầu của khách hàng đến việc đảm bảo tính đúng đắn của mã nguồn.	application/pdf	0	t	This document covers software implementation, emphasizing coding standards, correctness, and integration. It details implementation steps, coding principles, exception handling, and naming conventions. Code inspection criteria for classes, attributes, constructors, and methods are outlined. Standard metrics like LoC and Cyclomatic Complexity are introduced. The integration process, including build processes, spiral development, and testing (regression, installation, acceptance), is explained. Factors determining integration sequences are also addressed, along with a focus on keeping coding goals in mind.	8123da1f-2817-4668-8d57-f07c7f4d6068		Bach khoa University	[0.0236721,0.059390683,-0.010244574,0.023062093,0.0165835,-0.06013777,-0.019654483,-0.03528174,0.03740252,0.025424613,-0.02403872,0.013878033,0.11421071,0.03672183,-0.03803646,-0.060255505,-0.004334689,-0.0010203383,0.05568722,-0.011740066,0.027990038,-0.034467667,-0.004986977,-0.014097581,0.023632923,-0.02117467,0.022942739,0.040718537,0.001066073,0.032809753,0.033674333,-0.04558636,0.035522237,0.03535895,0.0332579,-0.0015293015,-0.0052205566,-0.046677187,-0.015524023,0.039443012,0.012852685,0.023621272,0.040157538,-0.0032109716,0.013202592,-0.018353308,0.019594036,0.01804389,-0.011709579,-0.009098503,0.047286708,0.005670146,0.035216887,0.029039158,-0.060752593,-0.024753442,0.0072956267,0.017103076,-0.026840761,0.0086276075,-0.0465229,0.05590107,-0.009260225,0.027731435,0.07984425,-0.05575539,0.0009221295,-0.032102127,-0.018426651,-0.0056469487,0.012325081,-0.0469549,0.0