b0baf9ba-5da6-4dc5-8b2c-b543d38b299b.pdf	Tài liệu tập trung vào các khái niệm cốt lõi của kỹ thuật phần mềm, đặc biệt nhấn mạnh vào chất lượng và đảm bảo chất lượng. Nó thảo luận về tầm quan trọng của chất lượng phần mềm, các loại thử nghiệm khác nhau (như kiểm thử phát triển, kiểm thử phát hành, kiểm thử người dùng), và các giai đoạn khác nhau của quá trình kiểm thử. Tóm lại, tài liệu cung cấp cái nhìn tổng quan về các phương pháp và nguyên tắc đảm bảo chất lượng phần mềm hiệu quả.	application/pdf	0	t	The document covers software quality, testing methodologies, and quality assurance processes. It includes topics like software quality attributes, various testing stages (development, release, user), and different testing types such as unit, component, and system testing. Furthermore, it discusses the importance of automated testing, test-driven development, and regression testing. The document also emphasizes the importance of user testing, particularly acceptance testing, and outlines different testing levels.	d73dfffc-55af-4c7a-bc20-1078ad80b1ec		Bach khoa University	[0.008161321,0.03969383,-0.01750919,0.020379849,0.016045425,-0.042203233,-0.041905455,-0.019081417,0.031454902,0.044565007,-0.029409055,0.015195678,0.072531566,0.0299875,-0.020391611,-0.054951318,0.03860713,-0.024535352,0.029892836,0.008937203,0.037461754,-0.030203287,0.022069296,-0.028439743,-0.014429791,-0.024728669,0.05593712,0.022143621,-0.02421249,0.029670624,0.041062452,-0.016436268,0.048153963,0.049819153,0.033588625,0.036227725,-0.03824264,-0.03167218,0.015056438,0.046528544,0.042134136,0.038862254,0.025690118,-0.026369484,-0.0006839072,-0.037813902,0.039972827,0.043248948,0.0025297122,-0.026397834,0.042835914,0.029332217,0.06005198,0.0031517032,-0.055331677,-0.021567803,0.0038579474,0.02544065,-0.0378576,0.043558255,-0.013627139,0.042286314,-0.031530336,0.040914383,0.02727023,-0.04633978,0.017008267,-0.038432576,-0.021620482,0.006463245,0.009307172,-0.030933874,0.0794574,-0.00047435277,-0.0144